I was discussing the phones idea with a friend just now (I hope that he 
doesn't post as well..) and we thought that this was an excellent idea and had 
a few ideas:

(some of these may be a little silly...)

a) Phone booths.
To make a call you use a phone booth (costing money). As well as using it, 
you could kick the phone, which would have a chance of generating money, or 
changing the phone to being vandalised, as which point it would no longer 
work. Vandalising a phone would be bad for luck for lawful characters.

b) Mobile phones.
A charged magic item. Enables you to make a call from anywhere. However, there 
will be a small chance for someone to call you, which would awaken sleeping 
monsters.

c) Phone numbers.
You may see phone numbers as graffiti, with no explanation. Call them to see 
what they are. Possibly numbers should be random for each game. This would 
need a new list: phone numbers known.

d) Phoning your god.
Phoning a god is like praying, only more effective. However, there would be a 
small chance that you catch them at a bad time which would really piss them 
off!

e) Pizza delivery.
There should be several competing delivery companies that take more or less 
time to deliver and provide different quality of pizza.


